---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Release Date & Roadmap – Studio Umbra Launch History | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Roblox STAND OUT release date, development milestones, and future roadmap. Track the evolution of Studio Umbra's JoJo game and upcoming Stand releases."
  canonicalPath="release-date"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Release Date & History' }]}
  schemaType="Article"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-emerald-200">
        <span>Development History</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Studio Umbra: Europa</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Out Release Date &amp; Roadmap
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Curious about when Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong> originally launched and what content is scheduled for future updates? Here is the full chronological record of development milestones and confirmed upcoming features.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- History Timeline -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-8 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Development Milestones</h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">September 2026</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Closed Playtesting &amp; Core Engine</h3>
          <p>
            Studio Umbra hosted private community playtests focusing on Stand summoning, basic M1 light combos, and combat camera shiftlock.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">October 20, 2026</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Official Public Launch</h3>
          <p>
            STAND OUT launched to the general public on Roblox with 35 starter Stands, initial Passione train raids, and the D'Arby Stand storage counter.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">Late October 2026</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Part 3 &amp; Part 5 Focus Arrows Update</h3>
          <p>
            Major system patch introducing craftable Part 3 and Part 5 Focus Arrows at the Crafting Station, adding Kraft Work, and revamping the Vampire fighting style.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-emerald-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold">November 2026 (Current)</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Continuous Balance &amp; 77 Rings Raids</h3>
          <p>
            Implementation of the 77 Rings multi-wave knight trials, level progression expansion, and 0.12s parry combat tuning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Future Roadmap -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-xl">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-amber-400 mb-4">Confirmed Upcoming Roadmap</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Based on official Studio Umbra developer board entries under "Unfinished / In Testing / Reworking", the following Stands and systems are in active development:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Part 6 &amp; Part 8 Upcoming Cards</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400">Whitesnake &rarr; C-Moon &rarr; Made in Heaven evolution line, plus the newly added Part 8 <em>Rock Human</em> placeholder Sub-Ability card.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Recently Released &amp; Reworked</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400">The Hand, Crazy Diamond (Pinnacle), The Lock, and the Nov 24 Bad Company full squad rework are now live in-game.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
